msgstr ""
"2つ目の方法は、` `quarkus.hibernate-orm.schema-management.strategy=update` ` "
"を使用することです。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This approach is best when you do many entity changes but\n"
"still need to work on a copy of the production data\n"
"or if you want to reproduce a bug that is based on specific database entries."
"\n"
"`update` is a best effort from Hibernate ORM and will fail in specific "
